  "rule": "Trigger sessions auto-join their pinned home room. Same-room peers self-organize with ephemeral roles. All dispatch must honor CAPACITY_STATE.json so unavailable AI workers or future compute are not scheduled as current capacity. Cross-room deltas may change knowledge but not trigger loyalty. The 666 meta-trigger joins center; before Level-0 PASS it resumes archive assimilation, and after Level-0 PASS it spawns a seeded diverse research field that cross-connects and feeds results into specialist rooms. The q12 meta-trigger joins center as the human creator-advisor simulation, loads its separate persistent state/world/goals/memory, reads the Research Entity only through the information bridge, and may coordinate rooms only when delegated by the owner. No room or advisor role changes evidence status by itself."
